    "d2f3e665-9bf4-4aee-8b67-425b66d670c6": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "75f8a537-55ac-4222-9783-a4fd0477d5b9": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Foundations of Yoga",
            "text": "<ul><li>Yoga History & Philosophy: Learn about the roots of yoga, the Yoga Sutras, and the Eight Limbs of Yoga to build a strong foundation.<\/li><li>Asana Practice & Alignment: Dive deep into the key yoga postures, focusing on alignment, anatomy, and modifications for different body types and abilities.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "4c239ee9-479d-4f81-b5b6-a7c9750699a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Breathwork & Meditation",
            "text": "<ul><li>Pranayama Techniques: Study various breathwork techniques that enhance energy, relaxation, and focus.<\/li><li>Mindfulness & Meditation: Develop a consistent meditation practice and learn to guide others in mindfulness.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "0a6fb51b-ba50-461a-992b-45e0e72261a5": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Teaching Methodology",
            "text": "<ul><li>Class Sequencing & Theming: Learn to structure well-balanced yoga classes with thoughtful themes and creative sequences.<\/li><li>Hands-On Adjustments: Safely assist your students with hands-on adjustments and verbal cues.<\/li><li>Teaching with Confidence: Practice teaching in a supportive environment, refining your voice, presence, and communication skills.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "d5af11b3-e1d0-4ae7-aef9-b21af820cfff": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Anatomy & Physiology",
            "text": "<ul><li>Yoga Anatomy: Understand the body’s structure, common injuries, and how to prevent them through intelligent sequencing and alignment.<\/li><li>Energetic Anatomy: Explore the subtle body, including chakras, nadis, and energetic alignment in yoga practice.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
